/span><span begin="02:32.514" end="02:32.704">is </span><span begin="02:32.704" end="02:35.514">sweet </span><span begin="02:35.514" end="02:36.294">and </span><span begin="02:36.294" end="02:38.244">heady </span><span begin="02:39.114" end="02:40.253">where's </span><span begin="02:40.253" end="02:40.293">my </span><span begin="02:40.293" end="02:43.383">love </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.463" end="03:09.363"><span begin="02:49.463" end="02:50.083">Lilac </span><span begin="02:50.083" end="02:52.473">wine  </span><span begin="02:56.123" end="02:56.353">I </span><span begin="02:56.353" end="02:58.963">feel </span><span begin="02:58.963" end="03:01.893">unsteady  </span><span begin="03:02.793" end="03:03.623">where's </span><span begin="03:03.623" end="03:03.973">my </span><span begin="03:03.973" end="03:09.363">love </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.553" end="03:18.713"><span begin="03:12.553" end="03:13.143">Listen </span><span begin="03:13.143" end="03:13.393">to </span><span begin="03:13.393" end="03:14.813">me  </span><span begin="03:14.813" end="03:15.423">why </span><span begin="03:15.423" end="03:15.933">is </span><span begin="03:15.933" end="03:17.153">everything </span><span begin="03:17.153" end="03:17.753">so </span><span begin="03:17.753" end="03:18.713">hazy </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.073" end="03:31.343"><span begin="03:20.073" end="03:20.263">Isn't </span><span begin="03:20.263" end="03:20.443">that </span><span begin="03:20.443" end="03:21.943">she  </span><span begin="03:21.943" end="03:23.253">or </span><span begin="03:23.253" end="03:23.473">am </span><span begin="03:23.473" end="03:24.123">I </span><span begin="03:24.123" end="03:24.753">just </span><span begin="03:24.753" end="03:25.493">going </span><span begin="03:25.493" end="03:29.873">crazy  </span><span begin="03:29.873" end="03:31.343">dear </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:40.543" end="03:55.182"><span begin="03:40.543" end="03:40.863">Lilac </span